OL,3,GNEWSATwo men dead after three-car crash
OL,4,Aduring Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have died following a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash in West Lothian
OL,8,Fduring Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the 20-year-old
OL,11,Fdriver of a white BMW 116D and an
OL,12,F84-year-old man, who was driving a blue
OL,13,FPeugeot 208, were pronounced dead at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FThe collision happened on the B708
OL,17,FLower Bathville Road at about 12:15 on
OL,18,FSunday.
OL,20,FA 19-year-old man, who was a passenger
OL,21,Fin the BMW, was taken to hospital for
OL,22,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
